khart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"316a retire-single-pass-review: RED-first oracle (22 tests, tests/unit/test_cli_review_alias.py) authored and confirmed RED; edge/E2E held out from the implementer subagent (sonnet), which saw only 8 happy-path cases. Full oracle GREEN after restore. Three mutations each caught a held-out test. Post-handoff correction: rewrote the shim to DELEGATE to _review_plan by argv-forwarding rather than duplicating its body. Docs (llm-framework, cli-reference, output-schemas, AGENTS.md) corrected by orchestrator; mcp-reference regenerated. make lint + make typecheck + comment-hygiene all pass; module-size under cap. Committed 64cfa0d96b as RebarBotNava <joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com> and pushed to Gerrit change 1407 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1407). Awaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1 before close.","timestamp":1785900329909102001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"316a: patch set 2 pushed to Gerrit 1407 after Verified -1 on ps1. Two CI-only failures found and fixed: (1) reviewers/index.json is DERIVED - edited ticket_quality.md front-matter and regenerated (regenerated output byte-identical to the hand-edit); (2) test_llm_optionality.py:173 drove the review CLI arm with a positional reviewer which the shim now rejects, and the shim's lean-lane degradation contract genuinely changed (non-zero exit preserved, but the missing extra is now reported inside review-plan's verdict as coverage.llm_unavailable rather than as a bare Error: line) - added a _CLI_SHIMMED carve-out asserting the more specific real contract. Reproduced both in a locally-built clean no-agents venv before fixing. All CI-only derived-file gates re-run locally: prompt-index, env-registry, mcp-reference, docs-index, readme-quickstart, comment-hygiene - OK. Awaiting ps2 votes.","timestamp":1785901100290809001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"jo